# The Black Gate with cheats on: the debug menu (F2) sets the time to 10 PM, then spells by the
# cheat key (F5, cast by the Avatar): Light, Great Light, Fireworks, Weather, Thunder, Create
# Food, Tremor, and Lightning, Fire Field, Swarm and Explosion at a spot by the tree; then a
# book, a scroll and a plaque (F8): the night palette, the debug console, spell sprites and
# sounds, and the three readable fonts.
# Start: the save bg-newgame.scr ends with. Arguments: --program u7 p ABCD<0xFF>
#@start bg-start
#@args --program u7 p ABCD\0377
